{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa <strong>Click to train and build the ultimate body!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to train and watch your stats rise with every rep. Invest in upgrades, level up gym equipment, and maximize your gains to earn more points with every click. The stronger you become, the faster your progress \u2014 pushing you step by step closer to true Chad status.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/8a05f1103d70f2357bca4bf26523736c.avif?t=1770719769\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2764\ufe0f Unlock Hot Training Partners</strong>  <br>As your stats grow and your dedication pays off, you\u2019ll attract the attention of gorgeous gym girls. Leveling up your workouts doesn\u2019t just make you stronger \u2014 it unlocks new \u201ctraining sessions\u201d where you can get closer to each girl in increasingly intimate ways. Becoming a Chad isn\u2019t just about muscles\u2026 it\u2019s about who you get to share your gains with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/62a0a50a08218fcc7124c1efc01bb44d.avif?t=1770719769\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> <strong>\ud83d\udd13 Conquer the Girls, Unlock the Locker Room</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every girl you impress at the gym will be added to your private locker room, where you can revisit and unlock their exclusive content. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/1e164064797b649975876d4888ee2179.poster.avif?t=1770719769\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/1e164064797b649975876d4888ee2179.webm?t=1770719769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/1e164064797b649975876d4888ee2179.mp4?t=1770719769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f <strong>Training Scenes</strong><br> Each girl comes with 1 unique training scene (2-frame click animation) tied to the gym equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/2ad171f4740f759a1cd8158b9c803221.poster.avif?t=1770719769\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/2ad171f4740f759a1cd8158b9c803221.webm?t=1770719769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/2ad171f4740f759a1cd8158b9c803221.mp4?t=1770719769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Animated Scenes</strong><br>Unlock 2 fully animated scenes per girl, bringing your \u201cextra training\u201d to life with smooth, intimate motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/8f5c5403a4a8762d8c3c3b1055933765.poster.avif?t=1770719769\" width=1170 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/8f5c5403a4a8762d8c3c3b1055933765.webm?t=1770719769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/8f5c5403a4a8762d8c3c3b1055933765.mp4?t=1770719769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf19 Day &amp; Night Cycle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the gym like it\u2019s alive: time flows with a full day and night cycle that not only shifts the atmosphere but also changes the lighting and schedule across every part of the game. From the bright energy of the morning to the calm glow of the evening, every moment of the day offers a unique and immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/82569a136aef8cdfa3954a8685ddc27e.poster.avif?t=1770719769\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/82569a136aef8cdfa3954a8685ddc27e.webm?t=1770719769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/82569a136aef8cdfa3954a8685ddc27e.mp4?t=1770719769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Plan \u2014 Daily &amp; Weekly Challenges</strong><br>As time passes in-game, you\u2019ll unlock Daily Quests with a limited time window. Complete them before they expire to earn AC and XP and push your training forward. Throughout the week, Weekly Races will also appear\u2014tougher challenges with higher stat requirements and bigger rewards. Keep an eye on the current day, current time, and active quest count to plan your workouts and maximize your gains.<strong> </strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/831f57f39db4d9dd46c5df8a51384869.avif?t=1770719769\" width=1560 height=872 /></span><br><strong>Chibi Assignment \u2014 Power, Speed &amp; Passive Gains</strong>Your gym generates Energy. Spend it to assign Power and Speed to your chibi, then <strong>slot them into a machine</strong> to train that stat <strong>passively</strong> while you keep playing. Swap machines on the fly to chase goals, min-max builds, or prepare for Weekly Races.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/799db6682b5eeabf51c4dba5b31b547d.poster.avif?t=1770719769\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/799db6682b5eeabf51c4dba5b31b547d.webm?t=1770719769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/extras/799db6682b5eeabf51c4dba5b31b547d.mp4?t=1770719769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692130?t=1770719769","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/1f9b8022dc20e017cca6775bf55edb7bc57929ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770719769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/6f26dadf941fc7600db4b9e382f5287040b5dd8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770719769","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692130/6f26dadf941fc7600db4b9e382f5287040b5dd8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770719769","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"- All characters portrayed in this game are over the age of 18.\r\n- all scenes depicted in the game are consensual."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa <strong>Click to train and build t